    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make dark</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν θεὸν τὸν φωτίζοντα καὶ σκοτίζοντα
					τὸν κόσμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Tab.Defix.Aud.</u>
					242.13
				</span></i>
			 (Carthage, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>); <i>get in the light
			of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέργειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(2).698
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβὼν δισσὰς ἐσκότισας χάριτας
					Ἀρχ.Δελτ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.57
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Larissa</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Th.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				11.153a
			</span></i>; <i>stupefy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκορπίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					2.133
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be darkened</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1120e
			</span></i>; <i>to be blinded</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτισθήτωσαν οἱ ὀφθαλμοὶ αὐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					68(69).24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ διανοίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
					4.18
				</span></i>
			 (v.l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολῇ τὰς φρένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tz.
					<u>H.</u>
					8.929
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be dizzy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aesop.
				247b
			</span></i>.</div>
